	"changelog": "Initial release.\nAll core features implemented:\n- Text statistics (characters, words, lines, sentences, longest/shortest words, number count)\n- Clipboard copy, save to file, and selection info summary\n- Email selection count (Outlook, Gmail, Outlook Web)\n- Maths calculations (add, subtract, multiply, divide)\n- URL extraction and opening\n- Copy digits only\n- Voice guide for all commands\n- Fully configurable settings panel",
